{"id":822,"date":"2026-08-08T00:30:57","date_gmt":"2026-08-08T00:30:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/es\/?p=822"},"modified":"2026-08-08T01:40:54","modified_gmt":"2026-08-08T01:40:54","slug":"6-factores-clave-para-elegir-un-servicio-de-soporte-sap-24-7-para-su-empresa","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/es\/2026\/08\/08\/6-factores-clave-para-elegir-un-servicio-de-soporte-sap-24-7-para-su-empresa\/","title":{"rendered":"6 Factores Clave para Elegir un Servicio de Soporte SAP 24\/7 para su Empresa"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"822\" class=\"elementor elementor-822\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3a59f99 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3a59f99\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-28964c2\" data-id=\"28964c2\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c0fb9b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c0fb9b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Las empresas que operan con SAP dependen de la disponibilidad del sistema para ejecutar procesos cr\u00edticos como compras, producci\u00f3n, log\u00edstica, finanzas o ventas. Una interrupci\u00f3n, incluso de unos minutos, puede afectar la continuidad operativa, retrasar entregas o generar p\u00e9rdidas econ\u00f3micas.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Por esta raz\u00f3n, cada vez m\u00e1s organizaciones buscan un servicio de <\/span><b>Soporte SAP 24\/7<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> que les permita atender incidentes en cualquier momento y minimizar el impacto de una falla sobre la operaci\u00f3n.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sin embargo, no todos los proveedores ofrecen el mismo nivel de especializaci\u00f3n ni la misma capacidad de respuesta. Si su empresa est\u00e1 evaluando un servicio de soporte, estos seis factores le ayudar\u00e1n a tomar una decisi\u00f3n informada y alineada con las necesidades de su organizaci\u00f3n.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a5c71fe elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"a5c71fe\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-39fa852\" data-id=\"39fa852\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a68a8fa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a68a8fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>1. Disponibilidad real las 24 horas del d\u00eda<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-fd39e2a\" data-id=\"fd39e2a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-69e22a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"69e22a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">El primer aspecto que debe evaluar es si el proveedor realmente cuenta con un equipo disponible las 24 horas, los 7 d\u00edas de la semana.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Algunas empresas ofrecen atenci\u00f3n fuera del horario laboral \u00fanicamente bajo esquemas de guardia, lo que puede incrementar los tiempos de respuesta cuando ocurre una incidencia cr\u00edtica.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Un servicio profesional debe contar con consultores preparados para atender incidentes en cualquier momento, incluyendo fines de semana y d\u00edas festivos, garantizando la continuidad de la operaci\u00f3n cuando el negocio m\u00e1s lo necesita.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-30426e6 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"30426e6\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1024e7d\" data-id=\"1024e7d\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cbb6545 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cbb6545\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>2. Experiencia funcional y t\u00e9cnica en SAP<\/b><\/h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No todas las incidencias tienen el mismo origen. Algunas est\u00e1n relacionadas con procesos del negocio, mientras que otras requieren conocimientos t\u00e9cnicos sobre infraestructura, integraciones o rendimiento del sistema.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Por ello, es recomendable trabajar con un proveedor que disponga de consultores funcionales y t\u00e9cnicos con experiencia en diferentes m\u00f3dulos de SAP.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Esta combinaci\u00f3n permite resolver problemas con mayor rapidez y reducir el tiempo que la operaci\u00f3n permanece afectada.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adem\u00e1s, un equipo multidisciplinario puede identificar oportunidades de mejora que van m\u00e1s all\u00e1 de la resoluci\u00f3n de incidencias.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d0f3e45\" data-id=\"d0f3e45\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-303646e elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"303646e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f0650a1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"f0650a1\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-21c936a\" data-id=\"21c936a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-293fdaf elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"293fdaf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<!-- =========================================================\r\n     EMERSON RUSH \u00b7 ACUERDOS DE NIVEL DE SERVICIO (SLA) - 5 COLUMNAS\r\n     ========================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"er-sla-5col\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"er-sla-5col__header\">\r\n        <h2>\r\n            3. Acuerdos de Nivel de <span>Servicio (SLA)<\/span>\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <p>\r\n            Uno de los principales indicadores para evaluar un proveedor es la existencia de Acuerdos de Nivel de Servicio o SLA (Service Level Agreements).\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <p class=\"er-sla-5col__intro-list\">\r\n            Estos acuerdos establecen aspectos como:\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"er-sla-5col__grid\">\r\n\r\n        <!-- 01 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-sla-5col__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-sla-5col__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__number\">01<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-sla-5col__item-text\">\r\n                Tiempo m\u00e1ximo de respuesta.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-sla-5col__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-sla-5col__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__number\">02<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-sla-5col__item-text\">\r\n                Tiempo estimado de resoluci\u00f3n.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 03 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-sla-5col__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-sla-5col__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__number\">03<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-sla-5col__item-text\">\r\n                Clasificaci\u00f3n de incidentes.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-sla-5col__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-sla-5col__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__number\">04<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-sla-5col__item-text\">\r\n                Niveles de prioridad.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-sla-5col__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-sla-5col__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__number\">05<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-sla-5col__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-sla-5col__item-text\">\r\n                Procedimientos de escalamiento.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- DESTACADO \/ CONCLUSI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-sla-5col__card er-sla-5col__card--featured\">\r\n\r\n            <p>\r\n                Contar con SLA claramente definidos brinda mayor certeza a la empresa y facilita medir objetivamente el desempe\u00f1o del proveedor.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   CONTENEDOR (NOMBRES DE CLASE ISOLADOS: er-sla-5col)\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col{\r\n    --er-morado:#5D3271;\r\n    --er-azul:#071C3B;\r\n    --er-naranja:#CD5B56;\r\n    --er-gris:#F3F3F3;\r\n    --er-negro:#111111;\r\n    --er-blanco:#FFFFFF;\r\n\r\n    width:100%;\r\n    padding:65px 0;\r\n    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col *,\r\n.er-sla-5col *::before,\r\n.er-sla-5col *::after{\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   ENCABEZADO\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__header{\r\n    max-width:760px;\r\n    margin:0 0 42px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__header h2{\r\n    margin:0 0 18px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--er-azul);\r\n\r\n    font-size:38px;\r\n    line-height:1.15;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__header h2 span{\r\n    color:var(--er-morado);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__header p{\r\n    max-width:650px;\r\n    margin:0 0 12px;\r\n\r\n    color:#555555;\r\n\r\n    font-size:16px;\r\n    line-height:1.75;\r\n    font-weight:400;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__intro-list{\r\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\r\n    color: var(--er-azul) !important;\r\n    margin-top: 15px !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   GRID (5 COLUMNAS FIJAS EN DESKTOP)\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__grid{\r\n    display:grid !important;\r\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(5, 1fr) !important;\r\n    gap:18px !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   TARJETAS\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__card{\r\n    grid-column:span 1;\r\n\r\n    position:relative;\r\n\r\n    min-height:180px;\r\n    padding:24px 20px;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--er-gris);\r\n\r\n    border-top:3px solid var(--er-morado);\r\n\r\n    transition:\r\n        transform .25s ease,\r\n        box-shadow .25s ease,\r\n        background .25s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   N\u00daMERO Y L\u00cdNEA\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__top{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    gap:10px;\r\n\r\n    margin-bottom:20px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__number{\r\n    flex:0 0 auto;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--er-naranja);\r\n\r\n    font-size:13px;\r\n    line-height:1;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__line{\r\n    display:block;\r\n\r\n    width:30px;\r\n    height:1px;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--er-naranja);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   TEXTOS\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__item-text{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--er-azul);\r\n\r\n    font-size:16px;\r\n    line-height:1.4;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__card p{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   TARJETA DESTACADA (OCUPA LAS 5 COLUMNAS)\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__card--featured{\r\n    grid-column: 1 \/ -1 !important;\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    background:var(--er-azul);\r\n    border-top-color:var(--er-naranja);\r\n    min-height:auto;\r\n    padding:26px 28px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-sla-5col__card--featured p{\r\n    color:var(--er-blanco);\r\n    font-size:16px;\r\n    line-height:1.6;\r\n    font-weight:400;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   HOVER\r\n   =========================================================